WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose your language. Speak your problem or tap a service. Microphone access is optional.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Answer only the questions needed for guidance. Review and correct your answers. Never enter an OTP or banking PIN here.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Read or listen to the next step. Check what to prepare, the source, region and review date. Guidance is not approval.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Continue on the official service when ready. Applications and payments happen there. Keep its acknowledgement. Saathi does not book or submit for you.
